# Client TypeScript Build

- Client **must** use `Client/tsconfig.json` (`tsc -p tsconfig.json`). Never typecheck Client via root `tsconfig.json` (it pulls Server and causes mass false failures).
- Client build script: `tsc -p tsconfig.json && vite build`.
- Keep `noUnusedLocals`/`noUnusedParameters` pragmatic for WIP UI; fix real type errors (missing imports, union types, App.dispatch typing).
- Use `MessageInstance` for `App.useApp().message`, not static `antd` `message` type.
- Type Redux as `useDispatch<AppDispatch>()`.
- Ant Design `Card` has no `icon` prop — put icons in `title`.
- Exclude `vite.config.ts` from app `tsconfig` include.
